5. Conclusion The results of the experimental set-up presented in this paper validate the active thermosiphon design of the Super-FRS dipole. The heater on the return pipe allows to control the flow regime, direction and rate. A simple model comparing the driving pressure of the flow and the pressure losses gives a very good prediction of the experimental results and validates the calculations done for the real dipole.

